// Title: PowerShell Script Change Permission Via Set-Acl
// ID: bdeb2cff-af74-4094-8426-724dc937f20a
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-18
// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Detects PowerShell execution to set the ACL of a file or a folder
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAINS "Set-Acl " AND CommandLine CONTAINS "-AclObject " AND CommandLine CONTAINS "-Path ")) AND (((OriginalFileName EQUALS "PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName EQUALS "pwsh.dll")) OR ((Image="*\\powershell.exe" OR Image="*\\pwsh.exe"))))
